This tree is an export of the original author's private skills registry
(`acsi-agentskills-private` here) at commit
c4bf812e4703e7b9fdd3f5408ed9198cba9df9be. That repository is private and has
no license file of its own; only the files its export manifest includes were
copied (its export manifest, under export/manifests/): the marketplace and
plugin manifests, setup.sh, README.md, the lessons/ format with its invented
example, the CI workflow and the files _agent-guidance's sync delivers. Its
credential runbook and its one skill were not.

It has been modified by the adoption kit's export
(docs/reference/adopt-the-whole-system/export/export.py in _agent-guidance):
owner, repository, plugin, site and machine names were replaced with invented
ones, links to specific issues, pull requests and commits still point at the
original repositories, and the edits recorded in the manifest were applied.
Each change and its reason is listed in export/DECISIONS.md. It is distributed
with the adoption kit, under the kit's license (Apache License, Version 2.0,
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
